  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lok Capital is an impact investor which promotes inclusive growth in India by making long-term equity investments. It has operated since 2004. Its Growth Catalyst Partners LLC fund will focus on providing accessible finance to India&#x2019;s underserved communities. It also looks to expand into the agriculture and affordable healthcare sectors.</narrative>
